Penguin OS (LineageOS Base)
===========================

A custom ROM based on LineageOS 24.0 (Android 17/QPR1), maintained by the Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE organization.

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Penguin OS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the Penguin OS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

Please see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for building instructions, by device (adapt for Penguin OS).


Forked Repositories (Bare Minimum to Boot)
------------------------------------------

The following LineageOS repositories have been forked to the Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE organization and are used by this manifest:

### Core Platform
- [android_build](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_build) → `build/make`
- [android_build_soong](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_build_soong) → `build/soong`
- [android_art](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_art) → `art`
- [android_bionic](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_bionic) → `bionic`
- [android_libcore](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_libcore) → `libcore`

### Bootable
- [android_bootable_recovery](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_bootable_recovery) → `bootable/recovery`

### Development
- [android_development](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_development) → `development`

### Frameworks
- [android_frameworks_av](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_frameworks_av) → `frameworks/av`
- [android_frameworks_base](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_frameworks_base) → `frameworks/base`
- [android_frameworks_libs_systemui](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_frameworks_libs_systemui) → `frameworks/libs/systemui`
- [android_frameworks_native](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_frameworks_native) → `frameworks/native`
- [android_frameworks_opt_telephony](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_frameworks_opt_telephony) → `frameworks/opt/telephony`

### Hardware
- [android_hardware_interfaces](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_hardware_interfaces) → `hardware/interfaces`
- [android_hardware_libhardware](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_hardware_libhardware) → `hardware/libhardware`
- [android_hardware_libhardware_legacy](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_hardware_libhardware_legacy) → `hardware/libhardware_legacy`
