- [android_system_bt](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_system_bt) → `system/bt`
- [android_system_media](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_system_media) → `system/media`
- [android_system_netd](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_system_netd) → `system/netd`
- [android_system_vold](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_system_vold) → `system/vold`

### Vendor
- [android_vendor_lineage](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/android_vendor_lineage) → `vendor/lineage` *(Penguin OS branding, overlays, config)*

### Apps (from Project-PenguinOS)
- [penguin_packages_apps_Dialer](https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE/penguin_packages_apps_Dialer) → `packages/apps/Dialer` *(from Project-PenguinOS)*

### GMS (Google Mobile Services)
- **Codeberg:** [PenguinOS/android_vendor_gms](https://codeberg.org/PenguinOS/android_vendor_gms) → `vendor/gms` *(branch: celerity, from Project-PenguinOS/Neoteric-OS)*


Building with GMS
-----------------

To include Google Mobile Services in your build, set:
```bash
export WITH_GMS=true
```

This will automatically include the Project-PenguinOS GMS package from `vendor/gms`.


Submitting patches
------------------

Patches are welcome! Please submit your patches via GitHub Pull Requests to the respective repositories in the Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE organization.

For device-specific patches, please submit to the appropriate device repository.


Organization
------------

**GitHub:** https://github.com/Penguin-OS-LINEAGE-OS-BASE

This manifest is based on LineageOS 24.0 and incorporates components from Project-PenguinOS.
